    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Mages are workers of magical wonders, from spellcasting tyrants to reclusive witches. They delve into mystical secrets and know much about monsters, legends, omens and other lore, and they often surround themselves with allies or hired assistants to help with their research or their pursuit of power.</p><p>Mage apprentices are spellcasters of modest ability. Some study under accomplished mages; others were born with their power.</p>",
